        "This PR adds the GitHub Actions workflows that power the Radius extension for the **dev** environment:

- \`.github/workflows/radius-verify-credentials.yml\`
- Radius deploy workflow(s) under \`.github/workflows/\`
- Radius delete workflow(s) under \`.github/workflows/\`

They were committed to \`radius/setup-dev-workflows-op-http\` because direct pushes to \`main\` are not permitted. Merge this PR to enable deploying and deleting the application from the Radius canvas.",
